{{#> layout title=title page=page}}
{{#*inline "content"}}
{{#> components/page-header title=title subtitle="Every gateway conversation as the record shows it — who, which client and model, turns, tool calls, errors and denials, tokens and cache share, cost, latency — with the judge's one label where it exists."}}
{{#*inline "header_actions"}}<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--outline" href="/admin/analysis/skills">Skills</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--outline" href="/admin/conversations">Read conversations &rarr;</a> {{> components/export-button export}}{{/inline}}
{{/components/page-header}}
{{> analysis-subnav}}
<div class="sp-aconv-range">{{> components/tabs tabs=range_links nav_label="Window"}}{{> components/scope-filter scope_filter}}</div>
<div class="sp-kpi-grid sp-kpi-grid--compact sp-aconv-kpis">
{{#each kpis.tiles}}
<div class="sp-kpi sp-kpi--{{tone}} sp-kpi--spark" title="{{hint}}"><span class="sp-kpi__label">{{label}}</span><span class="sp-kpi__value">{{value}}</span><span class="sp-kpi__sub">{{note}}</span>{{> components/sparkline spark}}</div>
{{/each}}
</div>
<section class="sp-aconv-charts" aria-label="Over time">
{{#each charts}}<div class="sp-aconv-chart">{{> components/svg-line-chart this}}</div>{{/each}}
</section>
{{#> components/toolbar toolbar_count=count_label}}
{{#*inline "toolbar_filters"}}
<form class="sp-toolbar__filter sp-aconv-filter" method="get" action="/admin/analysis/conversations" role="search" id="aconv-filter-form">
<input type="hidden" name="group" value="{{filter.group}}">
<input type="hidden" name="project" value="{{filter.project}}">
<input type="hidden" name="since" value="{{filter.since}}">
<input type="hidden" name="by" value="{{filter.by}}">
<input type="hidden" name="sort" value="{{filter.sort}}">
<input type="hidden" name="dir" value="{{filter.dir}}">
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-model">Model</label>
<select id="aconv-model" name="model" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">All models</option>{{#each models}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-client">Client</label>
<select id="aconv-client" name="client" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">All clients</option>{{#each clients}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-flag">Record</label>
<select id="aconv-flag" name="flag" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">Any record</option>{{#each flag_options}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-skill">Skill</label>
<select id="aconv-skill" name="skill" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">All skills</option>{{#each skills}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-user">Person</label>
<select id="aconv-user" name="user_id" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">All people</option>{{#each users}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-category">Intent</label>
<select id="aconv-category" name="category" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">Any intent</option>{{#each categories}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-outcome">Outcome</label>
<select id="aconv-outcome" name="outcome" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">Any outcome</option>{{#each outcomes}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-judged">Judged</label>
<select id="aconv-judged" name="judged" class="sp-search-input"><option value="">Judged or not</option>{{#each judged_options}}<option value="{{this.value}}"{{#if this.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{this.label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
<label class="sp-u-sr-only" for="aconv-q">Search</label>
<input type="search" id="aconv-q" class="sp-search-input" name="q" placeholder="title, summary, tag, model, skill or person" value="{{filter.q}}">
<button class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--primary" type="submit">Apply</button>
</form>
{{/inline}}
{{#*inline "toolbar_actions"}}<div class="sp-aconv-facets">{{#each model_facets}}<a class="sp-aconv-facet{{#if is_active}} is-active{{/if}}" href="{{href}}" title="Model">{{label}} <b>{{count}}</b></a>{{/each}}{{#each client_facets}}<a class="sp-aconv-facet sp-aconv-facet--client{{#if is_active}} is-active{{/if}}" href="{{href}}" title="Client">{{label}} <b>{{count}}</b></a>{{/each}}</div>{{/inline}}
{{/components/toolbar}}
<section class="sp-section sp-aconv-block" aria-label="Breakdown">
{{> components/tabs tabs=breakdown_tabs nav_label="Breakdown"}}
{{#> components/table caption=(concat "Conversations " breakdown_label) modifier="sp-aconv-breakdown"}}
<thead><tr><th scope="col">{{breakdown_label}}</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">Conversations</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">People</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">Turns</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">Tools</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">Tokens</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num">Cost</th><th scope="col" class="sp-aconv-col-share" title="Share of the filtered set's cost">Share</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Failed requests">Err</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Denied tool calls">Denied</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Judge outcome achieved">Achieved</th><th scope="col" class="sp-table__cell--num" title="Mean judge completion over the judged conversations in the bucket">Done</th><th scope="col">Top intent</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#each breakdown}}<tr><td class="sp-table__cell--primary">{{#if href}}<a class="sp-table__link" href="{{href}}">{{label}}</a>{{else}}{{label}}{{/if}}</td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{formatNumber conversations}}</td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{formatNumber users}}</td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{formatNumber turns}}</td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{formatNumber tool_calls}}</td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{tokens_display}}</td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{cost_display}}</td><td class="sp-aconv-col-share"><span class="sp-aconv-bar" style="--sp-fill: {{cost_share_pct}}%"><i></i></span><span class="sp-aconv-bar__label">{{cost_share_pct}}%</span></td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num"><span class="sp-aconv-num sp-aconv-num--{{errors_tone}}">{{errors}}</span></td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num"><span class="sp-aconv-num sp-aconv-num--{{denied_tone}}">{{denied}}</span></td><td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{achieved_display}}</td><td class="sp-table__cell--num"><span class="sp-aconv-score sp-aconv-score--{{completion_tone}}" title="{{judged}} judged">{{completion_display}}</span></td><td>{{top_category}}</td></tr>
{{else}}<tr class="sp-table__empty"><td colspan="13">{{> components/empty-state heading="Nothing in this window" message="No conversation's last activity falls inside the window with these filters. Widen the window or clear a filter; the rollup job refreshes the record every minute."}}</td></tr>{{/each}}
</tbody>
{{/components/table}}
</section>
<section class="sp-section sp-aconv-block" aria-label="Conversations">
{{#> components/table caption="Conversations" pagination=pagination modifier="sp-aconv-table"}}
<thead><tr><th scope="col" class="sp-aconv-col-title">Conversation</th><th scope="col" class="sp-aconv-col-person">Person</th><th scope="col" class="sp-aconv-col-client">Client · model</th>{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.turns}}{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.tools}}{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.errors}}{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.tokens}}{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.cost}}{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.latency}}{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.duration}}<th scope="col" class="sp-aconv-col-spark" title="Tokens per turn, most recent turns">Turns</th><th scope="col" class="sp-aconv-col-skills">Skills</th>{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.completion}}{{> components/sort-header sort_headers.activity}}</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#each rows}}<tr data-context-id="{{context_key}}" data-category="{{judge.category}}">
<td class="sp-table__cell--primary sp-aconv-cell-title"><a class="sp-table__link" href="{{href}}" title="{{context_key}}">{{title}}</a>{{#if judge.judged}}<div class="sp-aconv-meta" title="{{judge.rationale}}"><span class="sp-aconv-intent">{{judge.category_label}}</span> · <span class="sp-aconv-outcome sp-aconv-outcome--{{judge.outcome_tone}}">{{judge.outcome}}</span>{{#if judge.summary}} · <span class="sp-aconv-summary">{{judge.summary}}</span>{{/if}}</div>{{else}}<div class="sp-aconv-meta">{{#if judge.pending}}queued for the judge{{else}}not judged yet{{/if}}</div>{{/if}}</td>
<td class="sp-aconv-cell-person"><a class="sp-table__link" href="{{user_href}}" title="{{user_key}}">{{display_name}}</a>{{#if group_name}}<div class="sp-aconv-meta">{{group_name}}{{#if project_name}} · {{project_name}}{{/if}}</div>{{else}}{{#if project_name}}<div class="sp-aconv-meta">{{project_name}}</div>{{/if}}{{/if}}</td>
<td class="sp-aconv-cell-client"><span class="sp-badge sp-badge--{{client.tone}}" title="{{client.title}}">{{client.label}}</span><div class="sp-aconv-meta sp-aconv-model" title="{{model}}{{#each extra_models}} · {{this}}{{/each}}">{{model}}{{#if extra_models}} <span class="sp-aconv-more">+{{len extra_models}}</span>{{/if}}</div></td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{turns}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num"><span class="sp-aconv-num sp-aconv-num--{{tools_tone}}" title="{{tools_title}}">{{tools_display}}</span></td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num"><span class="sp-aconv-num sp-aconv-num--{{errors_tone}}" title="Failed requests">{{errors}}</span>{{#if denied}} <span class="sp-aconv-num sp-aconv-num--{{denied_tone}}" title="Denied tool calls">⛔{{denied}}</span>{{/if}}{{#if safety}} <span class="sp-aconv-num sp-aconv-num--{{safety_tone}}" title="Safety findings">⚑{{safety}}</span>{{/if}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num sp-aconv-cell-tokens" title="{{tokens_title}}">{{tokens_display}}<span class="sp-aconv-cache sp-aconv-cache--{{cache_tone}}" style="--sp-fill: {{cache_pct}}%" title="{{cache_pct}}% of what the models read came from cache"><i></i></span></td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{cost_display}}</td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num"><span class="sp-aconv-num sp-aconv-num--{{latency_tone}}">{{latency_display}}</span></td>
<td class="sp-table__cell--num sp-u-num">{{duration_display}}</td>
<td class="sp-aconv-cell-spark">{{> components/sparkline spark}}</td>
<td class="sp-aconv-cell-skills"><div class="sp-aconv-skills">{{#each skills}}<a class="sp-aconv-skill{{#if hooked}} sp-aconv-skill--hooked{{/if}}" href="{{href}}" title="{{name}} — {{#if hooked}}reported by the harness hook{{else}}read from the transcript by the judge{{/if}}; opens the skill's analysis">{{name}}</a>{{else}}<span class="sp-u-text-tertiary">—</span>{{/each}}</div></td>
<td class="sp-aconv-col-judge"><a class="sp-aconv-score sp-aconv-score--{{judge.tone}}" href="{{href}}#judge" title="{{#if judge.judged}}{{judge.rationale}}{{else}}Not judged yet{{/if}}">{{judge.completion_display}}</a></td>
<td class="sp-col-date"><time datetime="{{last_full}}" title="{{last_full}}">{{last_display}}</time></td>
</tr>
{{else}}<tr class="sp-table__empty"><td colspan="14">{{> components/empty-state heading="No conversations match" message="Clear a filter or widen the window. A conversation appears here once the gateway has recorded a turn for it; the rollup job refreshes the record every minute."}}</td></tr>{{/each}}
</tbody>
{{/components/table}}
</section>
<details class="sp-analysis-definitions"><summary>Where these numbers come from</summary>
<p>Every conversation is a gateway context. Its turns, tool calls, tokens (input, output, cache read and write, reasoning), cost, latency percentiles, status and finish reason come from the request log; tool executions and artifacts from the tool-call ledger; allow / warn / deny from the governance spine; safety findings from the gateway scanners; prompts and skills from the harness hooks, attached through the Claude Code session id the gateway records on each request. Group and project are the ones stamped on the conversation's latest request. The <code>conversation_rollup</code> job re-derives a conversation's row within a minute of any of those planes changing.</p>
<p>The judge adds one label: a title, a summary, the intent (development, business analysis, operations, admin &amp; config, writing &amp; comms, research &amp; learning, other), an outcome and a single 0–100 <em>completion</em> score — did the assistant deliver what the person originally asked for. The <code>conversation_judge</code> job reads a conversation once it has been quiet or its session has ended, sends the transcript (credentials redacted) to the configured model with the response schema enforced by the provider API, and records one verdict; a conversation that keeps growing is read again. Its own gateway calls are audited under the job's identity and never counted as conversations.</p>
<p>Skills marked solid were reported by the harness hook and are evidence; outlined ones are what the judge read from the transcript. Each opens the skill's own analysis.</p>
</details>
{{/inline}}{{#*inline "scripts"}}<script type="module" src="/js/components/sp-chart.js?v={{css_version}}"></script>{{/inline}}{{/layout}}
